    "New and changed devices receive nothing until you approve them. Compare the code through a trusted channel first. Known devices can still receive messages." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "New and changed devices receive nothing until you approve them. Compare the code through a trusted channel first. Known devices can still receive messages."
